        <mxCell id="P8nuZcfdDzbOLzKd6KCD-23" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Given that the system has no records related to the following email and mobile number.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Newsletter subscription on CMS with email address.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;1.1 A new contact profile and a new subscription are created on CDC&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Contact&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Subscriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;1.2. The contact profile and subscription are&amp;nbsp;synchronised from CDC to CDP&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Contact&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Subscriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;1.3. The contact profile and subscription are synchronised from CDP to Emarsys&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Contact&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Subscriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;1.4. The contact profile is synchronised from CDP to C4C&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Contact&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Member registration on China App with mobile number and email address. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.1. A new contact profile, a new subscription and a new App membership are created on CDC&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;ontact (Last Name, First Name, Nickname)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Subscriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Memberships (Last Name, First Name, Nickname)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Contact&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.2. The contact profile, subscription and membership are&amp;nbsp;synchronised from CDC to CDP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.3. CDP matches&amp;nbsp;the existing contact with same email address&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.4. CDP adds the mobile number to the existing contact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.5. The new mobile number is synchronised to Emarsys&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;2.6. The new mobile number is synchronised to C4C.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. China Mobile Push by Mobile No. and Data Source&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Newsletter Emails Sent by Email and Data Source" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=16;" parent="AnEuvRO1PH_zX0HzJzEk-1" vertex="1">
